              "value": "Shadowplay"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(illusion, occult, shadow)\n\nRequirements: The wayang's last action was a melee Strike that damaged their opponent\n\nThe wayang attempts to Tumble Through the opponent's space, with a +2 circumstance bonus to the Acrobatics check. If they succeed, the wayang leaves a shadowy afterimage in their original space, and the opponent is flat-footed against the next melee attack the wayang attempts against it before the end of their current turn."
